# Identifiers and opaque tokens: the values applications pass around constantly.
# Two failure modes live here. High-entropy strings look like obfuscated
# payloads to entropy heuristics, and long digit runs look like card numbers to
# a naive regex — the exact false positive that made Gateon's old Visa-only
# card rule refuse order ids starting with 4.
